/typings

# System Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

.cursor/rules/nx-rules.mdc
.github/instructions/nx.instructions.md

# Replit
.cache/
.local/

# Environment files — real secrets (Clerk keys, DATABASE_URL, etc) live only
# in Replit Secrets or a local .env, never committed. .env.example files are
# intentionally NOT ignored — they document required var names with dummy values.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
